OL,3,GNEWSATeen fire death case against mum
OL,4,Aand brother ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FManslaughter charges against the mother
OL,7,Fand brother of a teenager who died in a
OL,8,Fhouse fire will not be pursued after
OL,9,Fprosecution experts changed their
OL,10,Fminds.
OL,12,FDanielle Johnson, 44, and Louis Casson,
OL,13,F20, had been due to stand trial accused
OL,14,Fof killing Leah Casson, 18, who died at
OL,15,Fthe family's home on Vicarage Street in
OL,16,FNorth Shields on 16 January 2023.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
