OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeen fire death case against mum
OL,4,Aand brother ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the trial starting at
OL,7,FNewcastle Crown Court, prosecutors said
OL,8,Fthe manslaughter charge against them
OL,9,Fand a third man, Calvin Smith, 38,
OL,10,Fwould be discontinued, with not guilty
OL,11,Fverdicts recorded.
OL,13,FJohnson and Smith admitted abstracting
OL,14,Felectricity. Johnson was given a
OL,15,Ftwo-year conditional discharge, while
OL,16,FSmith will be sentenced at a later
OL,17,Fdate.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
